    {
      "id": "claim_43c6d7cb192b445086fa06504aa84f07",
      "statement": "fail_closed is the shared error path for guards: it appends a timestamped line to .claude/session_logs/hooks-errors.log, emits a deny decision whose reason begins 'hook could not evaluate the request safely, denying:', and exits 2 so hosts that key blocking on exit status refuse the call; an empty payload is allowed while an unparseable one fails closed.",
