      "id": "claim_b90a0b2e2f9e407486db0b723ac82f43",
      "statement": "enforce-branch-state.sh requires a new branch to be named <plan_name>_implementation, created from a clean dev checkout, and backed by .claude/plans/<plan_name>.md with type big-plan, exactly one status field, and status planning or in-progress; a branch created in another repository via -C, --git-dir, or --work-tree is not judged by this repository.",
