      "statement": "enforce-commit-gate.sh stands down for commits targeting the nested .claude repository or another repository, requires an implementation branch for every other commit, runs assert_commit_invariants for ordinary commits, and lets bypass subjects (fixup!, squash!, eligible chore(typo): and docs(typo):) skip only the plan ceremony while still enforcing the branch check.",
