      "id": "claim_9693dbd2d52a4d29a3f60d06418df7d2",
      "statement": "enforce-pr-gate.sh lets a push aimed at the nested repository or another repository stand down but never a pull request, requires an implementation branch, requires --base dev for gh pr create, runs assert_closeout_invariants for pull requests and assert_push_invariants for pushes, and refuses a chained commit-and-push with an explanation that the gate evaluates the pre-commit HEAD.",
